<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<section xml:id="chapter-factorisation"><title>Factorisation</title>
        <section xml:id="factorisation-intro"><title>Reversing expansion</title>
          <p>Factorisation writes an expression as a product. For example, <m>6x+9=3(2x+3)</m>.</p>
        </section>
      </section>
